@node Top
@top Autoslip-Howm

@code{autoslip-howm} brings folgezettel-driven, automatic, bidirectional
linking to @uref{https://kaorahi.github.io/howm/, howm}.  It is a port of
@code{autoslip-roam} that replaces the org-roam database with a directory
scan and replaces UUID-based links with stable wiki keywords.
@end ifnottex

